    "text": "erienewsnow.com\nwebsite\nWarren County, Pennsylvania\nRally in the Valley Raises Over $10,000 for Local Veterans\nBy Jackie Palmer,\n3 hours agoClarendon, PA — The 8th Annual Rally in the Valley proved to be a major success this year, raising more than $10,000.00 for the Warren County Veterans Emergency Fund. Event organizers met with the board of directors of the Veterans Emergency Fund at the Clarendon VFW on Wednesday night to present a check and celebrate the community’s continued support for local veterans.\n1",
